{"lyrics":"[00:00.50][Intro: Juice WRLD & Future] DY\n[00:10.50]Krazy Hmm, I'm gon' kick it on this Max know we just stay kickin' that shit\n[00:17.08]Huh, I be kickin' that shit so much I damn near— should play soccer on\n[00:23.04]that bitch [Chorus] Don't be callin' up my phone with that fuck shit, no, not today\n[00:26.52]Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah Bro just got a new gun, it's from Russia, yeah it's\n[00:32.02]a K (Yeah) Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah Taking all these drugs, pray my body function,\n[00:37.26]tryin' to numb the pain Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah Not afraid to say I live\n[00:42.08]what I rap, it's the truth, I'm not ashamed Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah [Verse 1]\n[00:46.68]I got pills in my body (Yeah), bills in my pocket (Yeah)\n[00:49.36]They won't fit in the wallet (Yeah) Young, rich, and poppin' Safe full of commas, liver\n[00:54.46]filled with toxins Heart full of trauma, with the soul of a lion I'm touring, scoring,\n[00:59.92]stats like Jordan Places foreign (Yeah), crêpes in the morning (Hey) These hoes boring, got me\n[01:06.48]snoring So many hoes, if I wanted, I could go Mormon My anxiety is like my\n[01:11.30]cash flow, enormous My demons do what I do to my enemies, torment Said \"Fuck school,\"\n[01:17.20]those college dorms can suck my dick until the morning Sometimes life hits with no warning\n[01:24.88]Bites like Tyson, darkness swarming The few people that I love are my umbrellas when it's\n[01:32.86]storming [Chorus] Don't be callin' up my phone with that fuck shit, no, not today Uh,\n[01:37.22]uh, uh, uh, uh (Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah) Bro just got a new gun, it's\n[01:40.72]from Russia, yeah it's a K Uh, uh, uh, uh, uh (Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah)\n[01:44.96]Taking all these drugs, pray my body function, tryin' to numb the pain Uh, uh, uh,\n[01:49.02]uh, uh (Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah) Not afraid to say I live what I rap,\n[01:53.06]it's the truth, I'm not ashamed\n[01:56.00]Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah (Uh, uh) [Verse 2] Percs, lean, smoke, all to the brain\n[02:01.14](Ayy, ayy) I don't fuck with the soap or the coke I don't play those games\n[02:06.94]Nah, nah, I don't play nose games In the bed, codeine to the head with my\n[02:11.34]main thing She my all, so when we dropping drawls, raw dog game Who knew making\n[02:16.08]love'll put a damper on the rain? Didn't know what love was 'til she came my\n[02:20.44]way Uh, oh yeah, usually getting soaked in my thoughts, but I don't care Pray to\n[02:25.22]God, I don't know how I know, but I know he's there And I know that\n[02:28.52]life ain't fair Drugs, drama, love affairs Violence, hate, in the air But I still live\n[02:33.64]through those moments Take control of my situation, own it Pray to God for wisdom and\n[02:39.48]patience, need it Sometimes I forget everything happens for a reason [Chorus] Don't be callin' up\n[02:44.36]my phone with that fuck shit, no, not today Uh, uh, uh, uh, uh (Woah, woah,\n[02:49.02]woah, woah, woah) Bro just got a new gun, it's from Russia, yeah it's a K\n[02:52.68](Yeah) Uh, uh, uh, uh, uh (Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah) Taking all these drugs, pray\n[02:56.50]my body function, tryin' to numb the pain Uh, uh, uh, uh, uh (Woah, woah, woah,\n[03:01.02]woah, woah) Not afraid to say I live what I rap, it's the truth, I'm not\n[03:04.24]ashamed\n[03:06.56]Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah (Uh, uh)","words":[[0.5,0.64,"[Intro:"],[0.68,0.8,"Juice"],[0.84,0.98,"WRLD"],[1.0,1.02,"&"],[1.06,1.64,"Future]"],[1.68,1.7,"DY"],[10.5,10.62,"Krazy"],[10.68,10.74,"Hmm,"],[10.78,10.82,"I'm"],[10.86,11.04,"gon'"],[11.22,11.38,"kick"],[11.42,11.46,"it"],[11.56,11.58,"on"],[11.72,14.18,"this"],[14.22,14.4,"Max"],[14.48,14.64,"know"],[14.7,14.76,"we"],[14.82,14.9,"just"],[14.94,15.12,"stay"],[15.22,15.5,"kickin'"],[15.54,15.62,"that"],[15.7,15.82,"shit"],[17.08,18.68,"Huh,"],[18.72,18.72,"I"],[18.78,18.82,"be"],[18.9,19.16,"kickin'"],[19.2,19.26,"that"],[19.32,19.44,"shit"],[19.52,19.58,"so"],[19.7,19.86,"much"],[19.9,19.9,"I"]